msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr ""
"Tilgå foretrukkede forbindelser fra systembakken. Indtast et land eller "
"serverkoder, adskilt af kommaer, for hurtigt at oprette forbindelse (f.eks.:"
" NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "Den aktive port er {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "Tillad udvalgte apps at forbinde uden VPN-beskyttelse."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Beta-adgang er blevet deaktiveret.\n"
"Genstart appen for at lade ændringerne træde i kraft."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Beta-adgang er blevet aktiveret.\n"
"Genstart appen for at lade ændringerne træde i kraft."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr ""
"Omgå firewalls for at oprette forbindelse til P2P-servere og enheder på dit "
"lokale netværk. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"Optager et specifikt problem du har når du bruger Proton VPN, for at få hjælp fra vores kundesupport.\n"
"\n"
"Advarsel: Denne fil er en optagelse af alt din internetaktivitet under optagelsen."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr "Forbind til Proton VPN med dine egne domænenavnsservere (DNS)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Opret forbindelse til en Tor-server for at få adgang til skjulte tjenester "
"og onion-websteder ved hjælp af en hvilken som helst browser."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr ""
"Opret forbindelse til din destinationsserver via en anden VPN-server med "
"maksimal sikkerhed. Langsommere, men mere privat."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "Kopieret!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Nedbrudsrapporter hjælper os med at løse fejl, opdage firewalls, og undgå VPN-blokeringer.\n"
"\n"
"Statistikkerne indeholder ikke IP-adresser, og de kan ikke bruges til at identificere dig. Vi deler dem aldrig med tredjeparter."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr ""
"Tilpas din forbindelse ved at afgøre, hvilke apps skal beskyttes af VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr ""
"Deaktiverer tilfældig mapping af lokale adresser. Dette reducerer "
"forbindelsessikkerheden en smule, men burde tillade direkte forbindelser til"
" online gaming og lignende formål."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Deaktiverer beta-adgang..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "Hver kode kan kun bruges én gang"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Aktiverer beta-adgang..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr ""
"Få tidlig adgang og hjælp os med at teste nye versioner af Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr ""
"Hvis din sikkerhedsnøgle har en knap eller en guldskive, skal du trykke på "
"den nu."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr ""
"Øg din forbindelseshastighed med op til 400% med teknologier, der forbedrer "
"ydeevnen."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr "Indsæt U2F- eller FIDO-nøglen, der er knyttet til din Proton-konto. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Det var ikke muligt at deaktivere beta-adgang.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Det var ikke muligt at aktiverere beta-adgang.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "Kill switch blokerer alle udgående forbindelser."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Valg af nødstop er slået fra mens VPN-forbindelsen er aktiv. Afbryd for at "
"lave ændringer."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr "Flere sikkerhedsnøgler blev fundet. Klik på én for at vælge den."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr ""
"Kun udvalgte apps får forbindelse via VPN. Al anden trafik er ubeskyttet."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"Permanent Kill Switch blokerer alle udgående forbindelser og forhindrer din IP i at blive eksponeret.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du deaktivere Kill Switch?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr "Opret en ny VPN-forbindelse for at lade ændringerne træde i kraft."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr ""
"Beskyt dig selv mod reklamer, malware og trackere på hjemmesider og i apps."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "Protokollen kan kun ændres når VPN-forbindelsen er afbrudt."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Valg af protokol er slået fra mens VPN-forbindelsen er aktiv. Afbryd for at "
"lave ændringer."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ved at lukke programmet afbrydes din nuværende VPN-forbindelse.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du fortsætte?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ved at lukke applikationen forbliver kill switch aktiv, men din nuværende VPN-forbindelse afbrydes.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du fortsætte?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "Rapporterer dit problem..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "Logger ind..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ved at logge ud afbrydes din nuværende VPN-forbindelse og kill switch deaktiveres.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du fortsætte?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ved at logge ud afbrydes din nuværende VPN-forbindelse.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du fortsætte?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ved at logge ud deaktiveres kill switch, hvilket potentielt kan afslører din internettrafik. \n"
"\n"
"Vil du fortsætte?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "Logger ud..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr "Split tunneling aktiveret. Husk at genstarte berørte apps."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr "Disse servere giver den bedste ydeevne til BitTorrent og fildeling."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr ""
"Denne teknologi gør det muligt for Proton VPN at tilbyde højere hastighed og"
" sikkerhed i lande, som er vanskelige at tilgå."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "Dette vil deaktivere NetShield."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "Dette vil deaktivere brugerdefineret DNS."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Tunnelerer IPv6-trafik gennem VPN'en. Kan forbedre kompatibiliteten med "
"IPv6-netværk."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr "Appen starter minimeret, hvis aktiveret."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Du vil blive forbundet til en server så snart Proton VPN-appen starter. "
"Erstat den med et lands ISO-kode (f.eks.: US for United States), en server "
"(f.eks.: NL#42) eller Hurtigste for hurtig forbindelse. Standardværdi: Fra."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your issue has been reported"
msgstr "Dit problem er blevet rapporteret"

